4. TELEMETRY, CODE INTEGRITY & ZERO CODE RETENTION
The Software operates on ephemeral pull request diffs transmitted securely via TLS 1.3
encryption to authorized Ribbsaeter Systems API endpoints. Licensor enforces a strict
Zero Code Retention policy: source code diffs processed during verification runs are
evaluated solely in volatile memory and are never retained, stored, logged, or utilized
to train third-party artificial intelligence foundation models.

